# Cloudflare Workers static-assets headers (copied to .open-next/assets).
# The service worker script must always revalidate — a stale sw.js pins users
# to an old app. Next's own headers() entry covers `next start` (e2e).
# Statiske filer (/_next/static, ikon, manifest) går forbi Worker-koden og får
# derfor IKKE next.config.ts sine headers. HSTS gjelder hele opprinnelsen, så den
# må følge med her også. Ingen includeSubDomains (andre *.sundaysuite.app-apper).
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
/sw.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate
  Service-Worker-Allowed: /
  Content-Type: text/javascript; charset=utf-8
/manifest.webmanifest
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600
/icons/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400
